   ('p',"Anything that replies automatically at scale should run on Meta's official WhatsApp Business Platform, on your own verified number. Tools that automate the regular app or use unofficial connections risk getting the number banned. Meta charges per message on the platform; we explain the current rules in [WhatsApp API charges in the UAE](insights-whatsapp-api-charges-uae.html)."),
