   ('p',"If you only need to confirm that a message arrived, the free [WhatsApp auto reply](insights-whatsapp-auto-reply-business-uae.html) in the Business app is enough. If customers ask real questions and you want those chats to turn into bookings, an AI agent pays back far faster than a menu bot, because it does not lose people halfway through."),
   ('p',"We build [WhatsApp AI agents](whatsapp-ai-agent-uae.html) for clinics, restaurants, real estate and service businesses across the UAE. You can [try a live demo](ai-automation.html) on your own phone before deciding anything, or read [which businesses gain most](insights-whatsapp-ai-agent-industries-uae.html)."),
